sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor CU as customer
    actor W as waiter
    actor C as chef
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database

    CU->>API: POST /api/reservations (type=Application, party_size, date)
    API->>DB: reservation status=Pending
    API-->>CU: 201 reservation Pending
    W->>API: PATCH /api/reservations/:id (status=Confirmed)
    W->>API: POST /api/reservations/:id/tables (table_id, start_time, end_time)
    API->>DB: reservation_table row created
    Note over CU,W: guests arrive, security verifies reservation_code
    W->>API: POST /api/orders (order_type=Reservation, reservation_id, customer_id)
    API-->>W: 201 order Pending
    W->>API: POST /api/orders/:id/meals (meal_id, quantity)[]
    API->>DB: sync meal_order lines
    W->>API: PATCH /api/orders/:id (status=Confirmed)
    C->>API: GET /api/orders?status=Confirmed
    API-->>C: 200 kitchen queue includes this order
    C->>API: PATCH /api/meal-order/:id (prepared=true)
    C->>API: PATCH /api/orders/:id (ready_for_service=true)
    W->>API: PATCH /api/orders/:id (status=Completed)
    API->>DB: order + reservation status=Completed
    API-->>W: 200 table freed for the next booking
